Validate project .env files against .env.schema.yaml contracts, generate initial .env files, and manage MCP secrets.

Usage:
  orbit env [command]

Available Commands:
  check       Validate project .env files against their .env.schema.yaml contracts
  setup       Generate .env files from schemas and initialize .cursor/mcp.env

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for env

Global Flags:
      --config string   Custom path to Orbit CLI configuration file

Use "orbit env [command] --help" for more information about a command.
